{"steam_appid":3404470,"steam_name":"Maltese's Fluffy Onsen","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3404470/574603159/4a3210e89c0d6212bdb59d3ca8d65f4a10cddd49/1778051733/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1778719669","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257332143/ae85487e23a094a28e901ec56cd61f0be31752f0/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1778719669","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404470/ss_834543616618f22b0d7e84298075548164035727.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786089315","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404470/ss_e5bada93ebeff0e2b07ca8fec99028a4b0953224.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786089315","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404470/263f81e12aa77a2054b3590903b389b2cde3eb81/ss_263f81e12aa77a2054b3590903b389b2cde3eb81.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786089315","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404470/1cc25a774e26681c77e0894415d0b69a53673e07/ss_1cc25a774e26681c77e0894415d0b69a53673e07.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786089315","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404470/24bcc2938b55bcefd3214382be0e5e36131f8f9b/ss_24bcc2938b55bcefd3214382be0e5e36131f8f9b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786089315"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404470/extras/df60e4b16c8e1565d87563723ae98fca.poster.avif?t=1786089315\" width=700 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404470/extras/df60e4b16c8e1565d87563723ae98fca.webm?t=1786089315\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404470/extras/df60e4b16c8e1565d87563723ae98fca.mp4?t=1786089315\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run a bathhouse visited by animals! <i>Maltese's Fluffy Onsen</i> is a relaxing simulation game that you can enjoy while doing other tasks, as it sits at the bottom of your screen. Place baths with different temperatures and rest areas to help a variety of animal friends unwind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404470/extras/234405ab1640acf384348b707a92b4c7.avif?t=1786089315\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Cozy Bathhouse</strong><br>Help your animal guests relax and unwind with a warm bath. Set the water temperature to your liking—cold, warm, or hot—or create special baths using bubble machines and herbal bags.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404470/extras/8fac7ed81d591b0052a6f1d0a2025a80.poster.avif?t=1786089315\" width=720 height=178 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404470/extras/8fac7ed81d591b0052a6f1d0a2025a80.webm?t=1786089315\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404470/extras/8fac7ed81d591b0052a6f1d0a2025a80.mp4?t=1786089315\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Refreshing Drinks and Snacks</strong><br>Create a relaxing space for animals to rest after a good soak. From vending machines with thirst-quenching drinks to snack stands that fill their tummies, you have plenty of options to keep them happy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404470/extras/051d5287ad05e32a881f6ed8c74c8011.poster.avif?t=1786089315\" width=616 height=164 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404470/extras/051d5287ad05e32a881f6ed8c74c8011.webm?t=1786089315\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404470/extras/051d5287ad05e32a881f6ed8c74c8011.mp4?t=1786089315\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your Very Own Bathhouse</strong><br>Have you ever dreamed of owning a bathhouse? Design it your way, from nostalgic tiled interiors to open-air baths that warm you up just thinking about them. Make your dream bathhouse a reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404470/extras/6e3bbfb4fd73996d9445bc4114bfe59e.poster.avif?t=1786089315\" width=616 height=164 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404470/extras/6e3bbfb4fd73996d9445bc4114bfe59e.webm?t=1786089315\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404470/extras/6e3bbfb4fd73996d9445bc4114bfe59e.mp4?t=1786089315\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404470/extras/5ac7e7ed2fd502e10b84222378d4939e.avif?t=1786089315\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Variety of Animal Guests</strong><br>Cats, dogs, rabbits, hamsters, and more. Many different guests from the animal world come to relax and unwind. Run your bathhouse and meet all kinds of wonderful visitors.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404470/extras/5c7c40a48a30f83d26cbaa6b1eb2ba16.poster.avif?t=1786089315\" width=616 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404470/extras/5c7c40a48a30f83d26cbaa6b1eb2ba16.webm?t=1786089315\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404470/extras/5c7c40a48a30f83d26cbaa6b1eb2ba16.mp4?t=1786089315\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Helpful Staff to Lend a Hand</strong><br>Great service takes effort and care. Manage your staff to keep the floors dry and safe, restock supplies, and make sure every guest has a fantastic experience.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404470/extras/8c336da9af812b7bd36f17723b3d0675.poster.avif?t=1786089315\" width=616 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404470/extras/8c336da9af812b7bd36f17723b3d0675.webm?t=1786089315\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404470/extras/8c336da9af812b7bd36f17723b3d0675.mp4?t=1786089315\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(*Please note that the bathing habits of animals in the game may differ from those of real animals.)</p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel® Core™ i3 @ 3.2 GHZ<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Graphics card with DX9<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 9.0<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 256 MB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"","genres":["Casual","Indie","Simulation"],"developers":["Sinkhole Studio","Moonlab Studio"],"publishers":["Sinkhole Studio","Paleo","XD"],"release_date":"13 May, 2025"}